ext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 16 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>16</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p>"},{"id":"d92a04a4-4a1c-494c-8f3e-7e6a801d0902","content":"<p><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 8 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p>"}],"keys":["74cfc327-2358-4705-8750-4a3481d577e8"],"correct_answer":["A"],"rationale":"<p>Choice A is correct. It's given that <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></msup></math> and <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"x minus 4\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mn>4</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math> for <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> in <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></msup></math> yields <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x minus 4\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Substituting <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> for <math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> in this equation yields <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x minus 4\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Using the properties of exponents, the function <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x minus 4\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>272</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline Over 2 Superscript 4 Baseline EndFraction\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>272</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals StartFraction 272 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x Baseline Over 16 EndFraction\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>272</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 17 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></msup></math>. Therefore, of the given choices, an equation that defines function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 17 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>x</mi></msup></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice B is incorrect. This equation defines function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> if <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis x minus 2 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, not <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice C is incorrect. This equation defines function <math alttext=\"h\"><mi>h</mi>\n</math> if <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis 4 x right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, not <math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals f left parenthesis x minus 4 right parenthesis\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>.</p>\n<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1730147357400,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"dcf63c94","skill_cd":"P.C.","score_band_range_cd":6,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","createDate":1730147357400,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"","external_id":"406ed77a-b110-44a7-9d44-1c6ff1aa5918","primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"d7311803-c3f1-4d17-81a4-b62917c024ae","difficulty":"H"},"raw_detail":{"answerOptions":[{"content":"<p><math alttext=\"h left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 17 left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis Super