    ($SATQ$dd4ab4c4$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$09342-DC$SATQ$, $SATQ$disclosed$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.A.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Equivalent expressions$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 5, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, $SATQ$<div class="stimulus_reference " xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1"><p class="standalone_statement style:1 "><span class="math_expression "><span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/dd4ab4c4/img_004_d62fb4b2.png" alt="4 a squared, plus 20 a b, plus 25 b squared"></span></span></p></div>
