    ($SATQ$de39858a$SATQ$, $SATQ$1456688b-dc2f-4218-865c-e9bd32de6518$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$38bf5399-4922-4030-abdb-2b9d32ea06e3$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.C.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Nonlinear functions$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 7, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style='text-align: left;'>The function <math><mi>h</mi>
</math> is defined by <math><mrow><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy='true' fence='true' form='prefix'>&#x00028;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy='true' fence='true' form='postfix'>&#x00029;</mo></mrow><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#x0002B;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></math>, where <math><mi>a</mi>
</math> and <math><mi>b</mi>
</math> are positive constants. The graph of <math><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&#x0003D;</mo><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo stretchy='true' fence='true' form='prefix'>&#x00028;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy='true' fence='true' form='postfix'>&#x00029;</mo></mrow></mrow></math> in the <math><mrow>
	<mi>x</mi>
	<mi>y</mi>
</mrow>
</math>-plane passes through the points (<math><mn>0</mn>
</math>, <math><mn>10</mn>
</math>) and (<math><mn>-2</mn>
