<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for graph of a parabola" class="sr-only"><ul><li>The parabola opens upward.</li><li>The vertex is at the point (2 comma negative 2).</li><li>The parabola passes through the following points:<br><ul><li>(1 comma negative nine tenths)</li><li>(2 comma negative 2)</li><li>(3 comma negative nine tenths)</li></ul></li></ul></div></figure></p>
